: "%", "group": "shooting", "invert": false, "desc": "Share of shots on target — saved, or in."}, {"key": "goal_90", "label": "Goals", "unit": "/90", "group": "shooting", "invert": false, "desc": "Non-penalty goals per 90."}, {"key": "conversion_pct", "label": "Converts", "unit": "%", "group": "shooting", "invert": false, "desc": "Non-penalty goals per shot. Famously the least stable number in football — check what the gate says for this position before you weight it."}, {"key": "bigchance_shot_90", "label": "Big chances he gets", "unit": "/90", "group": "shooting", "invert": false, "desc": "Chances Opta rates as big that fell to him. Getting into those positions is a repeatable habit; what happens next may not be."}, {"key": "bigchance_conv_pct", "label": "Takes his big chances", "unit": "%", "group": "shooting", "invert": false, "desc": "Share of big chances he scored. The number everyone reaches for to call a player a bottler, on a sample of about ten a season."}, {"key": "bigchance_missed_90", "label": "Big chances missed", "unit": "/90", "group": "shooting", "invert": true, "desc": "Big chances that fell to him and did not go in, per 90."}, {"key": "decisive_90", "label": "Decisive acts", "unit": "/90", "group": "decisive", "invert": false, "desc": "Goals, assists, big chances made, saves, last-ditch blocks and tackles, penalties won — minus own goals, errors, penalties conceded and red cards. Valued in goals and netted off. One list for every position; what a player is judged on sorts itself out, a keeper's being 95% saves and a striker's 71% goals."}, {"key": "decisive_lev_90", "label": "Decisive acts, weighted by the moment", "unit": "/90", "group": "decisive", "invert": false, "desc": "The same, with every act weighted by how much the match hung on it. A goal at level with five minutes left counts 2.3 times; the fourth in a 4-0 counts nothing."}, {"key": "decisive_bad_90", "label": "Costly mistakes", "unit": "/90", "group": "decisive", "invert": true, "desc": "The negatives alone — own goals, errors, penalties conceded, red cards — per 90."}, {"key": "availability_pct", "label": "Available", "unit": "%", "group": "decisive", "invert": false, "desc": "Share of his club's minutes he was on the pitch for, across the matches his club played while he was there. Being fit and being picked is part of being dependable."}, {"key": "save_pct", "label": "Saves what he faces", "unit": "%", "group": "keeping", "invert": false, "desc": "Saves as a share of shots on target faced (saves plus goals conceded). Heavily driven by the quality of chance he faces, which is not his doing."}, {"key": "save_90", "label": "Saves", "unit": "/90", "group": "keeping", "invert": false, "desc": "Saves per 90. A busy keeper is usually a keeper behind a bad defence."}, {"key": "conceded_90", "label": "Goals conceded", "unit": "/90", "group": "keeping", "invert": true, "desc": "Goals conceded per 90 while he was on the pitch. As much a measure of his team as of him."}, {"key": "catch_pct", "label": "Holds it", "unit": "%", "group": "keeping", "invert": false, "desc": "Share of saves he catches rather than parries. A choice, and a nerve."}, {"key": "parry_danger_pct", "label": "Parries into danger", "unit": "%", "group": "keeping", "invert": true, "desc": "Of the saves he parries, the share he pushes back into a dangerous area rather than away."}, {"key": "claim_90", "label": "Comes for crosses", "unit": "/90", "group": "keeping", "invert": false, "desc": "High claims attempted per 90 — command of his box."}, {"key": "claim_pct", "label": "Claims it cleanly", "unit": "%", "group": "keeping", "invert": false, "desc": "Share of high claims he takes cleanly, counting crosses he came for and missed against him."}, {"key": "punch_90", "label": "Punches", "unit": "/90", "group": "keeping", "invert": false, "desc": "Punches per 90 — the alternative to catching it."}, {"key": "sweeper_90", "label": "Sweeps behind the line", "unit": "/90", "group": "keeping", "i